Subject: [PATCH] Offer neutral recall inputs to map inference only

Keep Samsung SBert and URL labels. The opt-in helper marks exact neutral output
for local action inference; all other gate results remain unchanged. Restrict
marked model results to Browse Location after Samsung extraction and validation.
The existing unsafe return and normal action routes remain intact. No register
count changes. Requires NativeMapGate in the generated client helper.

--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/GatingModelFactory$GatingModelWrapper.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/GatingModelFactory$GatingModelWrapper.smali
@@ -590,5 +590,9 @@
 
     move-result-object p0
 
+    invoke-static {p1, p0}, Lio/mesalabs/rezoss/ai/NativeMapGate;->extend(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/util/List;)Ljava/util/List;
+
+    move-result-object p0
+
     return-object p0
 .end method
--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/RecallProvider.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/RecallProvider.smali
@@ -540,6 +540,10 @@
     move-result-object v2
 
     :goto_2
+    invoke-static {v8, v2}, Lio/mesalabs/rezoss/ai/NativeMapGate;->filter(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/util/List;)Ljava/util/List;
+
+    move-result-object v2
+
     if-eqz v6, :cond_a
 
     new-instance v3, Lcom/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/recall/model/SavePlacesActionBuilder;
